<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Course Details | Skill Bridge</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.1.1/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; }
        
        /* Brand Colors: #0a2b3e (dark navy), #1a6f8c (teal), #0066b3 (blue) */
        .btn-primary-custom { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a2b3e, #1a6f8c); transition: all 0.2s; color: white; }
        .btn-primary-custom:hover { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a2b3e, #0066b3); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(26,111,140,0.3); }
        
        /* Glowing hero section - brand colors */
        .hero-glow {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e6f4f5 0%, #d4eef2 50%, #c2e8ef 100%);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-glow::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(26,111,140,0.12) 0%, rgba(0,102,179,0.06) 50%, transparent 70%);
            animation: rotateGlow 20s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes rotateGlow {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        
        /* Brand grid pattern */
        .brand-grid {
            background-image: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #1a6f8c 0px, #1a6f8c 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 50px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #1a6f8c 0px, #1a6f8c 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 50px);
            background-size: 50px 50px;
        }
        
        .brand-grid-light {
            background-image: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #5ba3bc 0px, #5ba3bc 0.5px, transparent 0.5px, transparent 40px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #5ba3bc 0px, #5ba3bc 0.5px, transparent 0.5px, transparent 40px);
        }
        
        /* Floating animation for decorative elements */
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(5deg); }
        }
        .float-animation { animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
        .float-delay-1 { animation-delay: 1s; }
        .float-delay-2 { animation-delay: 2s; }
        
        /* Shine effect on cards */
        .shine-card {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .shine-card::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -60%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 90%);
            transform: rotate(25deg);
            animation: shine 8s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shine {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%) rotate(25deg); }
            20%, 100% { transform: translateX(100%) rotate(25deg); }
        }
        
        .mentor-card { transition: all 0.3s; }
        .mentor-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 20px 30px -12px rgba(26,111,140,0.2); }
        
        .offering-card {
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .offering-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px -12px rgba(26,111,140,0.15);
        }
        
        .project-card {
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }
        
        .certificate-badge { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #5ba3bc, #1a6f8c); }
        .help-card { transition: all 0.2s; }
        .help-card:hover { background: #e6f4f5; }
        .breadcrumb a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        #videoModal { backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
        .lecture-item { cursor: pointer; }
        .lecture-item:hover { background: #e6f4f5; }
        
        .glow-text {
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(26,111,140,0.3);
        }
        
        .help-split-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .help-split-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 28px 48px -12px rgba(26,111,140,0.2); }
        .person-illustration {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e6f4f5, #d4eef2);
        }
        .question-mark-big {
            font-size: 5.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0a2b3e, #1a6f8c);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .question-mark-small {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a6f8c, #5ba3bc);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .float-question {
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .input-field {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            background: #f9fafb;
        }
        .input-field:focus {
            border-color: #1a6f8c;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(26,111,140,0.12);
            outline: none;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        .confused-person-img {
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 4px solid rgba(26,111,140,0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .confused-person-img { width: 140px; height: 140px; }
            .question-mark-big { font-size: 4rem; }
        }
        
        .brand-accent {
            border-left: 4px solid #1a6f8c;
        }
        
        .project-dot {
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .project-dot.active {
            background-color: #1a6f8c;
            width: 24px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
     
    <%- include("../partials/common/navbar")  %>

    <!-- Mobile Menu -->
    <div id="mobileMenu" class="fixed inset-0 bg-gray-900 z-50 hidden flex-col p-6 pt-24">
        <button id="closeMenu" class="absolute top-6 right-6 text-3xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-white"></i></button>
        <div class="flex items-center bg-gray-800 rounded-full px-4 py-3 mb-6">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-search text-gray-400 mr-2"></i>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Search courses..." class="bg-transparent text-white placeholder-gray-400 text-sm w-full focus:outline-none">
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-xl">
            <a href="/" class="font-semibold text-gray-300 py-3 border-b border-gray-800">Home</a>
            <a href="/about" class="font-semibold text-gray-300 py-3 border-b">About</a>
            <a href="/courses" class="font-semibold text-gray-300 py-3 border-b">Courses</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-gray-300 py-3 border-b">Contact</a>
            <div class="flex gap-4 mt-4">
                <button class="flex-1 bg-transparent border border-gray-600 text-gray-300 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold">Login</button>
                <button class="flex-1 btn-primary-custom text-white py-3 rounded-full font-semibold">Enroll Now</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
    <main>
        <!-- Course Header - BRAND GLOWING HERO with GRID PATTERN -->
        <div class="hero-glow pt-28 pb-16 relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Brand Grid Pattern Layers -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08] brand-grid"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.05] brand-grid-light"></div>
            
            <!-- Diagonal grid pattern for extra depth -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.04]"
                style="background-image: 
                    repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #1a6f8c 0px, #1a6f8c 0.5px, transparent 0.5px, transparent 80px),
                    repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #1a6f8c 0px, #1a6f8c 0.5px, transparent 0.5px, transparent 80px);">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Floating decorative elements -->
          
            
            <!-- Glowing orbs -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-teal-400/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-400/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
            
            <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
                <div class="breadcrumb text-sm mb-4">
                    <a href="/" class="text-teal-700/70 hover:text-teal-700">Home</a>
                    <span class="text-teal-700/40 mx-2">/</span>
                    <a href="/courses" class="text-teal-700/70 hover:text-teal-700">Courses</a>
                    <span class="text-teal-700/40 mx-2">/</span>
                    <span class="text-teal-800 font-medium" id="courseBreadcrumb">Web Development</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
                    <div class="flex-1">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-teal-200 mb-4">
                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                            <span class="text-teal-600 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">Most Popular Course </span>
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 glow-text" id="courseTitle">
                            Web Development with <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-600 to-blue-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Generative AI</span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-2xl" id="courseShortDesc">
                            Master HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, MongoDB, and integrate Generative AI to build intelligent full-stack applications.
                        </p>
                        
                        <!-- Stats badges -->
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-6">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal-100">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-star text-teal-500"></i>
                                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">4.9 ★ (2.5k+ ratings)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal-100">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-user text-teal-500"></i>
                                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">15k+ students enrolled</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal-100">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-teal-500"></i>
                                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">Updated monthly</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Floating price card in hero -->
                    <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-2 pb-4 shadow-2xl border border-teal-200">
                        <img src="/shahid2.png" width="250px" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Course Content -->
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12 max-w-6xl">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Left Column -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-8">
                    <!-- What You'll Learn -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-lightbulb text-teal-500"></i> What You'll Learn</h2>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3" id="whatYouLearn"></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Syllabus -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 flex-wrap gap-3">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-rectangle-list text-teal-500"></i> Course Content</h2>
                            <button id="downloadBrochureBtn" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 border border-teal-300 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-teal-500 hover:text-white transition-all"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i>Download Brochure</button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="courseContent"></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Requirements -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-list-check text-teal-500"></i> Requirements</h2>
                        <ul class="space-y-2" id="requirements"></ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Description -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-lines text-teal-500"></i> Description</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed" id="fullDescription"></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Sidebar - sticky with brand accent -->
                <div style="width: 450px;" class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-teal-100 sticky top-24">
                        <div class="relative h-48 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4">
                            <img id="courseImage" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?w=600&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Course" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/30 to-transparent"></div>
                            <span class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 bg-teal-500 text-white text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Bestseller</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2" id="sidebarTitle">Web Development with Generative AI</h3>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                            <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600" id="coursePrice">₹5,999</span>
                            <span class="text-sm text-gray-400 line-through" id="originalPrice">₹20,000</span>
                            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full" id="discount">70% off</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock w-5 text-teal-500"></i> <span id="courseDuration">6 Months</span></div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><i class="fa-regular fa-signal w-5 text-teal-500"></i> <span id="courseLevel">Beginner to Job Ready</span></div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><i class="fa-regular fa-certificate w-5 text-teal-500"></i> <span>Certificate of Completion</span></div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock w-5 text-teal-500"></i> <span>Lifetime Access</span></div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="w-full btn-primary-custom text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all enroll-btn hover:scale-105">Enroll Now <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2"></i></button>
                        <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">Join 15,000+ successful students</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SECTION 1: EXCLUSIVE COURSE OFFERINGS ===== -->
            <div class="mt-16">
                <div class="text-center mb-12">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-100 border border-teal-200 mb-4">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-star text-teal-500 text-sm"></i>
                        <span class="text-teal-600 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">WHY CHOOSE US</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Exclusive Course Offerings</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Industry-oriented curriculum designed to make you job-ready with comprehensive learning support</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                    <!-- Card 1 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-teal-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-industry text-teal-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Industry-Oriented Curriculum</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Curriculum designed in collaboration with industry experts to meet current market demands.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 2 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-100 to-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-blue-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Comprehensive Learning Content</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Video lectures, reading materials, quizzes, and hands-on coding exercises.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 3 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-100 to-purple-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-alt text-purple-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Weekend Live Sessions</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Interactive live classes every weekend with industry mentors and Q&A sessions.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 4 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-100 to-rose-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project text-rose-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Capstone Project</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Build real-world projects that showcase your skills to potential employers.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 5 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-ruler text-amber-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Practice Exercises</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Topic-wise coding challenges and practice problems to strengthen your concepts.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 6 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-100 to-green-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open text-green-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Assignments and Projects</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Regular assignments and mini-projects to apply what you've learned.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 7 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-100 to-cyan-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-headset text-cyan-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Live Doubt Resolution Sessions</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Get your doubts resolved instantly during scheduled live doubt-clearing sessions.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 8 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 to-indigo-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard-user text-indigo-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">SME Support Session</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Subject Matter Expert support for in-depth understanding of complex topics.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 9 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-certificate text-emerald-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Certification of Completion</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Earn a globally recognized certificate upon successful course completion.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 10 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-100 to-orange-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn text-orange-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Career Guidance & Interview Preparation</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Resume building, mock interviews, and placement assistance to kickstart your career.</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Card 11 -->
                    <div class="offering-card bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 to-sky-200 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-sky-600 text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Email Support</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">24/7 email support to address your queries within 24 hours.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SECTION 2: STUDENT PROJECTS SHOWCASE ===== -->
            <div class="mt-16">
                <div class="text-center mb-12">
                
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Projects</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Real-world projects built by our students - from AI chatbots to full-stack applications</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
